  "title": "夏季特賣",
  "summary": "每次夏特或冬特就迎來了steam最好玩的遊戲──「買遊戲」。挑選完一堆評價超高又精心製作的高品質遊戲結帳後，就可以安心關電腦了，就可以好好享受它們了！",
  "content": "<p>每次夏特或冬特就迎來了steam最好玩的遊戲──「買遊戲」。挑選完一堆評價超高又精心製作的高品質遊戲結帳後，<del>就可以安心關電腦了</del>，就可以好好享受它們了！</p>\n<h2>本次購物車品項<a href=\"https://shuojen.com/blog/2026/07/04/steam#%E6%9C%AC%E6%AC%A1%E8%B3%BC%E7%89%A9%E8%BB%8A%E5%93%81%E9%A0%85\" title=\"本次購物車品項的直接連結\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">​</a></h2>\n<ol>\n<li><a href=\"https://store.steampowered.com/app/1062090/_Timberborn/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Timberborn</a></li>\n</ol>\n<p>沙盒城市類型的建造生存類遊戲，很有趣，以河狸為主角建造發展城市度過末日。</p>\n<ol>\n<li><a href=\"https://store.steampowered.com/app/246620/Plague_Inc_Evolved/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Plague Inc: Evolved</a></li>\n</ol>\n<p>小時候在手機上玩過的經典遊戲，特價 39 塊！買來回味一下。</p>\n<ol>\n<li><a href=\"https://store.steampowered.com/app/1948980/_/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">大俠立志傳：碧血丹心</a></li>\n</ol>\n<p>小時候玩的經典 flash 金庸群俠傳的作者，半瓶神仙醋，竟然還有新作品，考慮買來玩看看。</p>\n<ol>\n<li><a href=\"https://store.steampowered.com/app/1749860/Lushfoil_Photography_Sim/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Lushfoil Photography Sim</a></li>\n</ol>\n<p>存了很久的拍照遊戲，愛攝影也不用出門了（？），畫面真的看起來很美。</p>\n<ol>\n<li><a href=\"https://store.steampowered.com/app/2001120/_/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Split Fiction</a></li>\n</ol>\n<p>跟蝦波玩完<a href=\"https://shuojen.com/blog/2026/05/10/it_takes_two\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">雙人成行</a>之後，對這款很有興趣。</p>\n<ol>\n<li><a href=\"https://store.steampowered.com/app/2951770/Leap_Year/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Leap Year</a></li>\n</ol>\n<p>格友 Alex 推薦，畫風很可愛，又很便宜想玩看看。</p>\n<ol>\n<li><a href=\"https://store.steampowered.com/app/3894790/_/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Professor Simulator</a></li>\n</ol>\n<p>主題很好笑，適合讀過研究所的同學玩。</p>\n<ol>\n<li><a href=\"https://store.steampowered.com/app/4704690/MECCHA_CHAMELEON/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">MECCHA CHAMELEON</a></li>\n</ol>\n<p>最近很紅的躲貓貓派對遊戲，很好笑，很適合多人一起同樂的感覺。</p>\n<ol>\n<li><a href=\"https://store.steampowered.com/app/1349230/5D_Chess_With_Multiverse_Time_Travel/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">5D Chess With Multiverse Time Travel</a></li>\n</ol>\n<p>格友 LQ7 推薦，特價了想買來玩看看，感覺就很有趣！</p>",
